NC Digital offers fully managed starter websites for small businesses across East Wales — a complete website package built, hosted, and managed for you from **£20 per month inc. VAT**.

Every plan includes a professionally built website, your own custom domain, fast UK hosting with SSL, daily backups, and ongoing technical management. We add new pages every month to grow your Google visibility.

## Plans from £20/month inc. VAT

- **Starter — £20/month inc. VAT** — 5 new pages added per month
- **Growth — £35/month inc. VAT** — 10 new pages added per month
- **Scale — £50/month inc. VAT** — unlimited new pages added per month

See our [managed starter websites service](/services/managed-starter-websites/) for full plan details.

## Areas we cover across East Wales

We offer managed starter websites for businesses throughout East Wales, including [Mold](/managed-starter-websites-mold/), [Flint](/managed-starter-websites-flint/), [Buckley](/managed-starter-websites-buckley/), [Holywell](/managed-starter-websites-holywell/), [Ruthin](/managed-starter-websites-ruthin/), [Denbigh](/managed-starter-websites-denbigh/), and surrounding areas. We also cover [South Wales](/managed-starter-websites-south-wales/), [North Wales](/managed-starter-websites-north-wales/), and the rest of [Wales](/managed-starter-websites-wales/).

We also offer [web design in East Wales](/web-design-east-wales/), web development in East Wales, and [local SEO for East Wales businesses](/seo-east-wales/).

We also offer [website maintenance across East Wales](/website-maintenance-east-wales/).

